  "description_html": "The 4th update of CS:GO Weapon Pack is now available after a long time !<br><br>What does the package contains ?:<br><br><ol><li>Low Poly View Models (CT & T Hands) With HD Textures</li><li>Low Poly Player & World Models</li><li>Buy Menu Pictures</li><li class=\"SelectedElement\">Extra/Alternative Weapons</li><li class=\"SelectedElement\">Knives (with every skin)</li><li><del>Higher Sound Quality Compared To <a href=\"https://gamebanana.com/skins/157208\">Pack #3</a></del>\u00a0 (not the case anymore since 21st July 2021)</li><li>Compile Files</li></ol><br>For the best texture quality use \"gl_max_size 512\" (without quotes).<br><br><a href=\"https://gamebanana.com/mods/287090\">CS:GO StatTrak Module</a>\u00a0works with this Pack ! <a href=\"https://gamebanana.com/mods/288843\">CS:GO Sticker System</a> may have some issues.<br>",
